## Success Criteria

Your work should:
1. ✅ Maintain layered architecture integrity
2. ✅ Ensure FIPS compliance when required
3. ✅ Follow OpenSSL development standards
4. ✅ Integrate properly with Conan ecosystem
5. ✅ Include comprehensive testing
6. ✅ Generate appropriate documentation
7. ✅ Support all deployment targets

